  "title": "focuser_primaluce switched the ARCO off at every rotator disconnect, so the next connect lost the ARCO calibration",
  "description": "The rotator disconnect sent {\"set\":{\"ARCO\":0}} and the connect {\"set\":{\"ARCO\":1}}. On a SESTO SENSO 3 (firmware 1.0.9) switching the ARCO port on again sets CALRESTART.MOT2, so the ARCO needed calibration after almost every connect. INDI only enables the ARCO.\n\nImported from .factory/findings/archive/FND-20261023193406-58c7-primaluce-arco-keep-enabled-001.json (category: functional, blocking: no).",
